--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -18,6 +18,11 @@ Docs: https://docs.openclaw.ai
 
 ### Fixes
 
+- Assistants: keep personal naming and style setup optional while handling authorized tasks.
+- Memory: accumulate settled conversation turns and bound overlapping extraction attempts without losing cursor updates.
+- Replies: reject invalid tool-protocol responses before text or speech delivery and ask users to check action status before retrying an uncertain result.
+- Security: redact supported credential fields from persisted tool results and protected text/speech output while retaining structured receipts and identifiers.
+- Hub tools: expose booking totals and truncation, exact count mode, and explicit all-time finance queries with validated calendar periods.
 - Alert watcher: recover persisted classification and suggestion results after restart, retain per-call billing, and prevent automatic retries of uncertain sends. (#356) Thanks @NikolasP98.
 - Alert watcher: expire retained source, reply and queue payloads before recovery delivery while preserving duplicate-prevention records. (#356) Thanks @NikolasP98.
 - Cron: validate explicit agent and session bindings when jobs are added, updated and executed so invalid targets cannot fall back to another agent. (#356) Thanks @NikolasP98.
